   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Four wind turbines turn under a blue sky dotted with clouds. In the foreground five rows of solar panels can be seen the with oilseed rape crop being grown between them.</rdf:li>
